 "note": "Standard '125 pinout (1OE 1A 1Y 2OE 2A 2Y GND 3Y 3A 3OE 4Y 4A 4OE VCC), same in every PDF: sn74lvc125a p.3 Table 4-1, sn74hc125 p.4, cd74hc125 p.3, cd74hct125 p.3, sn74ahc125 p.3 (D/DB/DGV/N/NS/J/W/PW and RGY/BQA same numbers), sn74ahct125 p.3, sn74act125 p.3 (PW, BQA), sn74hcs125 p.3 (D/PW/DYY, BQA), sn74abt125/sn74lvth125/sn74lv125a p.1 (incl. RGY), sn74ls125a/sn74f125/sn74bct125a/sn64bct125a/sn74alvc125/sn74auc125/sn74lvt125 p.1. QFN thermal pad is not a pin. Function table: OE low -> Y = A, OE high -> Z (every PDF). sn74ahc125-q1 p.3 Table 4-1 and its BQA figure put 3OE on 8 and 3Y on 10 while its D/PW figure on the same page shows the standard 8 = 3Y, 10 = 3OE; treated as a datasheet error (same die as SN74AHC125, whose BQA is standard).",
